## What to build

Join both reviewers into a bounded review-and-repair workflow. Run them against one stable commit, consolidate blocking findings into dedicated TDD repair tasks, and reuse the executor/merger/check pipeline. Allow at most three total review rounds with evidence-based re-review of disputed findings. Produce a final OpenCode and dashboard report and leave the feature branch ready without merging or publishing.

